{"page":271,"width":1690,"height":2367,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"이진 트리의 왼쪽 노드들은 NULL 노드에 도달할 때까지 스태에 추가되있다가 NULL 노드에 도","words":[{"text":"이진","x":205,"y":185,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"트리의","x":271,"y":186,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"왼쪽","x":365,"y":186,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"노드들은","x":431,"y":186,"width":107,"height":31},{"text":"NULL","x":549,"y":190,"width":57,"height":23},{"text":"노드에","x":616,"y":185,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"도달할","x":706,"y":186,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"때까지","x":796,"y":187,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"스태에","x":883,"y":186,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"추가되있다가","x":971,"y":185,"width":162,"height":33},{"text":"NULL","x":1143,"y":189,"width":59,"height":22},{"text":"노드에","x":1212,"y":185,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"도","x":1305,"y":190,"width":27,"height":22}]},{"text":"달하면 스택에서 하나씩 삭제된다. 이 삭제된 노드를 방문한 후에 노드의 오른쪽 노드로 이동한","words":[{"text":"달하면","x":173,"y":240,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"스택에서","x":267,"y":240,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"하나씩","x":390,"y":240,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"삭제된다.","x":481,"y":239,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"이","x":610,"y":238,"width":22,"height":33},{"text":"삭제된","x":645,"y":238,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"노드를","x":735,"y":241,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"방문한","x":825,"y":239,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"후에","x":913,"y":239,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"노드의","x":976,"y":239,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"오른쪽","x":1067,"y":239,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"노드로","x":1158,"y":240,"width":81,"height":24},{"text":"이동한","x":1250,"y":237,"width":82,"height":32}]},{"text":"다. 다시 이 노드의 왼쪽 노드들을 NULL 노드에 도달할 때까지 스택에 추가한다. 이 과정을 공백","words":[{"text":"다.","x":174,"y":295,"width":33,"height":31},{"text":"다시","x":222,"y":293,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"이","x":289,"y":293,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"노드의","x":326,"y":294,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"왼쪽","x":420,"y":293,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"노드들을","x":483,"y":293,"width":107,"height":31},{"text":"NULL","x":600,"y":297,"width":57,"height":23},{"text":"노드에","x":667,"y":292,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"도달할","x":756,"y":292,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"때까지","x":845,"y":292,"width":74,"height":32},{"text":"스택에","x":932,"y":291,"width":77,"height":32},{"text":"추가한다.","x":1022,"y":290,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"이","x":1149,"y":290,"width":23,"height":31},{"text":"과정을","x":1185,"y":289,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"공백","x":1277,"y":291,"width":51,"height":31}]},{"text":"스택이 될 때까지 되풀이 하면 이진 트리를 중위 순회할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"스택이","x":174,"y":347,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"될","x":267,"y":347,"width":26,"height":31},{"text":"때까지","x":306,"y":347,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"되풀이","x":398,"y":347,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"하면","x":488,"y":347,"width":51,"height":31},{"text":"이진","x":551,"y":346,"width":51,"height":33},{"text":"트리를","x":612,"y":346,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"중위","x":700,"y":345,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"순회할","x":762,"y":345,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":850,"y":346,"width":26,"height":30},{"text":"있다.","x":887,"y":345,"width":57,"height":31}]},{"text":"8.6 레벨 순회","words":[{"text":"8.6","x":173,"y":592,"width":56,"height":46},{"text":"레벨","x":245,"y":590,"width":84,"height":50},{"text":"순회","x":344,"y":589,"width":85,"height":50}]},{"text":"표준적인 순회 방법은 아니지만 레벨 순회도 많이 久卜\u0026된다. 레벨 순회(level order)는 각 노드를","words":[{"text":"표준적인","x":172,"y":730,"width":111,"height":30},{"text":"순회","x":293,"y":730,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"방법은","x":360,"y":730,"width":82,"height":30},{"text":"아니지만","x":451,"y":729,"width":109,"height":31},{"text":"레벨","x":570,"y":729,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"순회도","x":631,"y":729,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"많이","x":720,"y":728,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"久卜\u0026된다.","x":782,"y":728,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"레벨","x":909,"y":728,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"순회(level","x":970,"y":726,"width":120,"height":32},{"text":"order)는","x":1099,"y":726,"width":105,"height":32},{"text":"각","x":1215,"y":725,"width":26,"height":31},{"text":"노드를","x":1251,"y":725,"width":80,"height":30}]},{"text":"레벨 순으로 검사하는 순회 방법이다. 루트 노드의 레벨이 1이고 아래로 내려갈수록 레벨은 증가","words":[{"text":"레벨","x":173,"y":783,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"순으로","x":237,"y":784,"width":84,"height":30},{"text":"검사하는","x":332,"y":783,"width":110,"height":31},{"text":"순회","x":450,"y":783,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"방법이다.","x":515,"y":783,"width":112,"height":31},{"text":"루트","x":640,"y":784,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"노드의","x":702,"y":782,"width":77,"height":32},{"text":"레벨이","x":793,"y":783,"width":76,"height":32},{"text":"1이고","x":882,"y":782,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"아래로","x":955,"y":782,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"내려갈수록","x":1045,"y":781,"width":134,"height":31},{"text":"레벨은","x":1190,"y":780,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"증가","x":1278,"y":779,"width":54,"height":32}]},{"text":"한다. 동일한 레벨의 경우에는 좌에서 우로 방문한다. 지금까지의 순회법이 스택을 시용했던 것","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":171,"y":836,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"동일한","x":248,"y":836,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"레벨의","x":344,"y":836,"width":78,"height":31},{"text":"경우에는","x":437,"y":835,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"좌에서","x":555,"y":836,"width":77,"height":31},{"text":"우로","x":645,"y":836,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"방문한다.","x":708,"y":835,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"지금까지의","x":837,"y":837,"width":129,"height":31},{"text":"순회법이","x":979,"y":835,"width":103,"height":32},{"text":"스택을","x":1097,"y":835,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"시용했던","x":1188,"y":834,"width":106,"height":32},{"text":"것","x":1308,"y":834,"width":23,"height":31}]},{"text":"에 비해(코-드에는 스택이 나타나지는 않았지만 순환 호출을 하였기 때문에 간접적으로 스택을","words":[{"text":"에","x":172,"y":889,"width":24,"height":32},{"text":"비해(코-드에는","x":214,"y":889,"width":175,"height":32},{"text":"스택이","x":401,"y":888,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"나타나지는","x":496,"y":888,"width":134,"height":32},{"text":"않았지만","x":643,"y":889